<p>Habib Ibne Mazahir ..(2)<br />
 <br />

Yeh Khat Mein Shah Ne Likha Habib Aa Jao.<br>
Tumhara Dost Hai Tanha Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Shaheed Kaise Howa Woh Batao Gaye Aa Kar.<br>
Tum Haal-e-Muslim-e-Bekas Sunao Gaye Aa Kar.<br>
Ruqaiya(SA) Takti Hai Rasta Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Lagao Iss Se Bhi Andazay Meri Ghurbat Ke.<br>
Jahan Pe Ibn-e-Ali(AS) Likhna Tha Wahan Main Ne.<br>
Diya Hai Maa Ka Hawala Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Bata Raha Tha Osse Koi Bhi Nahi Hai Mera.<br>
Tu Bolin Sani-e-Zahra(SA) Habib(AS) Aaye Ga.<br>
Hai Oss Ko Tum Pe Bharosa  Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Woh Jab Yeh Sunti Hai Kofay Se Aa Rahe Hain Shaqi.<br>
Tu Pochti Hai Hamara Bhi Aaye Ga Koi.<br>
Duaein De Gi Sakina(SA) Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Gawara Kar Nahi Sakti Hussain(AS) Ki Ghirat.<br>
Tumhari Zoja Ki Chadar Loot Le Ummat.<br>
Tum Oss Ko Choor Ke Kofa Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Mujhe Hai Yaad Woh Lamha Jo Rab Ki Marzi Se.<br>
Tum Ho Ke Zinda Meri Baat Sunne Aaye The.<br>
Bula Raha Hoon Dobara Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Dar-e-Batool(SA) Dobara Jalaya Jaye Ga.<br>
Tumhare Dost Pe Khanjar Chalaya Jaye Ga.<br>
Nahi Hai Waqt Zyada Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Chamakte Chand Ki Hum Ko Bhi Deed Ho Jaye.<br>
Tum Aao Tu Mere Bachoon Mein Eid Ho Jaye.<br>
Bohat Udas Hai Kunba Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Yeh Khat Nahi Isse Behno Ki Aarzu Samjho.<br>
Hamare Lafzon Ko Zainab(SA) Ki Guftgu Samjho.<br>
Behan Yeh Kehti Hai Bhaiya Habib Aa Jao.<br>
<br>
Behan Ne Oss Ko :TAKALLUM: Jo Bhai Samjha Tha.<br>
Pukari Sham-e-Gharebaan Mein Sani-e-Zhara(SA).<br>
Hamara Lutta Hai Parda Habib Aa Jao.<br>
